BT /F1 8.7 Tf 0.12 0.18 0.20 rg 48 242.09999999999985 Td (ES modules: import/export connect server, services, routes, and React modules; package.json sets type=module.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 0.12 0.18 0.20 rg 48 229.39999999999986 Td (Async/await: Supabase and Axios calls return Promises; try/catch/finally controls loading and failures.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 0.12 0.18 0.20 rg 48 216.69999999999987 Td (React components: Functions such as SignIn, dashboards, assessment sections, and shared controls return UI.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 0.12 0.18 0.20 rg 48 203.9999999999999 Td (Props/state: Pages receive route/context data; useState stores form, loading, error, step, and domain state.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 0.12 0.18 0.20 rg 48 191.2999999999999 Td (Hooks: useEffect starts initialization/fetches, useCallback stabilizes handlers, useMemo derives values, useRef tracks async versions.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 0.12 0.18 0.20 rg 48 178.5999999999999 Td (REST: HTTP verbs express read/create/update/delete semantics under /api routes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 0.12 0.18 0.20 rg 48 165.89999999999992 Td (Middleware: Express functions authenticate, authorize, parse, or transform requests before controllers.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 0.12 0.18 0.20 rg 48 153.19999999999993 Td (CRUD: Admin, profile, availability, time-off, appointments, records, documents, and assessments all have CRUD-like flows.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 0.12 0.18 0.20 rg 48 140.49999999999994 Td (RLS: PostgreSQL policies evaluate auth.uid\(\) and role/access functions for row-level isolation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 0.12 0.18 0.20 rg 48 127.79999999999994 Td (Whitelisting: pick and knownKeys accept only explicit fields, limiting accidental or malicious updates.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 0.12 0.18 0.20 rg 48 115.09999999999994 Td (Debounced autosave: assessment pages delay draft PATCH calls and use refs to prevent overlapping saves.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.7 Tf 0.12 0.18 0.20 rg 48 102.39999999999993 Td (Internationalization: i18next keys supply English/Arabic labels and the document direction is synchronized.) Tj ET
